---
title: "burn (Sui Framework: coin)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_destruct: Coin(id, balance) destructured
    q_destruct --> q_delete_id: id.delete()
    q_delete_id --> q_decrease: cap.total_supply.decrease_supply(balance)
    q_decrease --> [*]: return burned_value

    note right of q_decrease
        INV-001: total_supply decreases by exactly the coin's balance value
        INV-002: coin object is destroyed (id deleted)
        INV-003: requires mutable TreasuryCap (authorization)
    end note
